msgid "Ainstein US-D1 Radar Altimeter"
msgstr "Ainstein US-D1 雷达高度计"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerotenna-usd1.rst:7
#: 360452b90efb4e8784bda290a4e31620
msgid ""
"The `Ainstein US-D1 Radar Altimeter <https://ainstein.ai/drone-makers-drone-"
"service-providers/us-d1/>`__ has a range of 50m, an update rate of 100hz and"
" weighs only 110g."
msgstr ""
"`Ainstein US-D1 雷达高度计 <https://ainstein.ai/drone-makers-drone-service-"
"providers/us-d1/>`__ 量程为 50m，更新频率为 100hz，重量仅 110g。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerotenna-usd1.rst:9
#: 0bebb4599c7d424e971c0dd8b810f80f
msgid ""
"currently the manufacturer warns that operation indoors can be problematic "
"due to multi-path reflections...caution is advised"
msgstr "目前制造商警告，由于多路径反射，在室内操作可能存在问题……请谨慎使用"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerotenna-usd1.rst:11
#: ef73d909d85e498090736844cecadcfe
msgid ""
"The user manual for this radar unit can be found `here. "
"<https://ainstein.ai/wp-content/uploads/US-D1-Technical-User-"
"Manual-D00.02.05.docx.pdf>`__"
msgstr ""
"该雷达单元的用户手册可在 `此处 <https://ainstein.ai/wp-content/uploads/US-D1-Technical-"
"User-Manual-D00.02.05.docx.pdf>`__ 查阅。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerotenna-usd1.rst:17
#: e675700ba13146589e1d3be31a602790
msgid ""
"Support for this sensor is available in ArduPilot firmware versions 4.0 and "
"later"
msgstr "ArduPilot 固件版本 4.0 及更高版本支持此传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerotenna-usd1.rst:20
#: 9cdb0e2e613f4a8baa75e93bb3b93442
