#: ../../source/docs/common-aerotenna-usd1.rst:25
#: 8d9fd5b6c20c473da006d5ec4bdd2e22
msgid "Connecting to the Autopilot"
msgstr "连接至飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerotenna-usd1.rst:27
#: cf6160db063c4f78bfd8fe22b0b055d2
msgid "The USD1 is available in serial and DroneCAN versions."
msgstr "USD1 提供串口和 DroneCAN 两种版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerotenna-usd1.rst:29
#: 5b6abd0751074818b28b4ec653536593
msgid ""
"For a serial connection you can use any spare Serial/UART port.  The example"
" below shows how to connect to SERIAL4 as the first rangefinder."
msgstr "串口连接可使用任意空闲的 Serial/UART 端口。以下示例演示如何将 SERIAL4 配置为第一个测距仪。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerotenna-usd1.rst:31
#: 30dbff822b77471ca3cd0562e7395093
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL <SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` = 9 (Lidar)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL <SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` = 9（激光雷达）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerotenna-usd1.rst:32
#: f6c8d913f48f493d85dc0afd108ac713
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL4_BAUD <SERIAL4_BAUD>` = 115 (115200 baud)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL4_BAUD <SERIAL4_BAUD>` = 115（115200 波特）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerotenna-usd1.rst:33
#: 6c9184791b0e4d88ac4a9694a2f3cb14
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 11 (USD1-Serial)"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 11（USD1-Serial）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerotenna-usd1.rst:34
#: ../../source/docs/common-aerotenna-usd1.rst:43
#: 38f19fa9c08d4b3d8362547e40474054 8aa01446ac8c4e5fbeed0890c541a4df
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 0.5"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 0.5"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerotenna-usd1.rst:35
#: ../../source/docs/common-aerotenna-usd1.rst:44
#: a99e251948904027b1388099eab36d90 c210edc25eeb4ee991d22389b623bf4f
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = 45"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = 45"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerotenna-usd1.rst:36
#: ../../source/docs/common-aerotenna-usd1.rst:45
#: 306ffc3f9a8d431ab735a16da16ec80b e2870a99e5204d7ab4ba87452b20801f
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_GNDCLR <RNGFND1_GNDCLR>` = 0.1 *or more accurately the "
"distance in meters from the range finder to the ground when the vehicle is "
"landed.  This value depends on how you have mounted the rangefinder.*"
msgstr ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_GNDCLR <RNGFND1_GNDCLR>` = 0.1 "
"*或更准确地说，是飞行器着陆时测距仪到地面的距离（单位：米）。该值取决于测距仪的安装位置。*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerotenna-usd1.rst:38
#: 7e6f3b49627d4cd6bb74a3cf0391f963
msgid ""
"For the CAN version, connect via CAN to the autopilot and set the following "
"parameters:"
msgstr "对于 CAN 版本，通过 CAN 连接到飞控并设置以下参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerotenna-usd1.rst:40
#: 48a1e77569b9485c900b2e94bd12941b
msgid ""
":ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER<CAN_P1_DRIVER>` =  1 (first can port driver set to "
"driver 1)"
msgstr ":ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER<CAN_P1_DRIVER>` = 1（第一个 CAN 端口驱动器设置为驱动器 1）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerotenna-usd1.rst:41
#: ffa9d15e2979461fad21bc2d8a848303
msgid ""
":ref:`CAN_D1_PROTOCOL<CAN_D1_PROTOCOL>` =  7 (USD1 protocol for driver 1)"
msgstr ":ref:`CAN_D1_PROTOCOL<CAN_D1_PROTOCOL>` = 7（驱动器 1 的 USD1 协议）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerotenna-usd1.rst:42
#: 44aff13910b2459dae15f11fac268930
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 33 (USD1_CAN)"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 33（USD1_CAN）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerotenna-usd1.rst:49
#: 95300b3615fc4922990bc269f059e4bc
msgid "Testing the sensor"
msgstr "传感器测试"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerotenna-usd1.rst:51
#: 1de383e571c54ca89fc2ed3f22a5887a
msgid ""
"Distances read by the sensor can be seen in the Mission Planner's Flight "
"Data screen's Status tab. Look closely for \"rangefinder1\"."
msgstr "传感器读取的距离数据可在 Mission Planner 飞行数据界面的状态标签页中查看，请注意查找 `rangefinder1`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerotenna-usd1.rst:59
#: dfea1d6593ba4b56a95c14ae5eeba8c6
msgid "Using the sensor with an AP Periph DroneCAN Node"
msgstr "通过 AP Periph DroneCAN 节点使用传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerotenna-usd1.rst:60
#: bc5282556c3b434ba2ebfaef2de76e5d
msgid ""
"The USD1 is available in either CAN or Serial communication protocol "
"versions. The USD1 CAN protocol is different than DroneCAN and hence "
"requires a dedicated CAN port running this protocol. If the autopilot does "
"not have a spare CAN port or spare serial port for conencting the USD1, but "
"has a DroneCAN port setup, you can create another serial port in the system "
"using an AP_Periph CAN node attached to the DroneCAN port. The USD1 MUST be "
"the Serial version for this to work."
msgstr ""
"USD1 提供 CAN 和串口两种通信协议版本。USD1 的 CAN 协议与 DroneCAN 不同，因此需要专用的 CAN "
"端口运行该协议。如果飞控没有空余的 CAN 端口或串口连接 USD1，但已配置了 DroneCAN 端口，可通过连接到 DroneCAN 端口的 "
"AP_Periph CAN 节点在系统中创建另一个串口。此方式必须使用串口版本的 USD1。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerotenna-usd1.rst:62
#: 3175cd4745a94c27b4db65c1f14e90c1
msgid ""
"To use the USD1 with a CAN Node like the Matek AP_Periph CAN Node L431, use "
"the following set up."
msgstr "若要将 USD1 与 Matek AP_Periph CAN 节点 L431 等 CAN 节点配合使用，请按以下步骤设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerotenna-usd1.rst:64
#: 1f2bbd1f1fd5404a941b017db0f0bcb8
msgid ""
"First, flash the AP_Periph device with a firmware that has the rangefinder "
"features. For the Matek AP_Periph CAN Node L431, the latest stable firmware "
"is `here. "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/AP_Periph/stable/MatekL431-Rangefinder/>`__"
msgstr ""
"首先，为 AP_Periph 设备刷入支持测距仪功能的固件。Matek AP_Periph CAN 节点 L431 的最新稳定固件可在 `此处 "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/AP_Periph/stable/MatekL431-Rangefinder/>`__ "
"获取。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerotenna-usd1.rst:69
#: dce004b0caab44e782ef133833d7f9ea
msgid "Set the parameters in the CAN Node to the following:"
msgstr "在 CAN 节点上设置以下参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerotenna-usd1.rst:71
#: 1bccc639dd4c4d239fc19841e1bad8a8
msgid "RNGFND_BAUDRATE = 115"
msgstr "RNGFND_BAUDRATE = 115"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerotenna-usd1.rst:72
#: 552f38863ea5480e9fa58da7a8733709
msgid "RNGFND_MAX_RATE = 50"
msgstr "RNGFND_MAX_RATE = 50"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerotenna-usd1.rst:73
#: af0a2a6c8b2242788977ffd671cf98ac
msgid "RNGFND_PORT = 1 (UART 2, i.e. TX2, RX2)"
msgstr "RNGFND_PORT = 1（UART 2，即 TX2、RX2）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerotenna-usd1.rst:74
#: c36aaa4a09b64d618bb3f6ff6a048148
msgid "RNGFND1_ORIENT = 0 (No matter what orientation)"
msgstr "RNGFND1_ORIENT = 0（任意方向均可）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerotenna-usd1.rst:75
#: 40509cc200c04f53be43fa2e55e2a131
msgid "RNGFND1_TYPE = 11"
msgstr "RNGFND1_TYPE = 11"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerotenna-usd1.rst:79
#: 17526662ab624869b6fb7e869a3e9ea9
msgid ""
"RNGFND_PORT is indexed differently than the UARTs on the board. For "
"RNGFND_PORT = 0, use RX1 and TX1 on the board, etc."
msgstr "RNGFND_PORT 的索引方式与板上 UART 不同。RNGFND_PORT = 0 时，使用板上的 RX1 和 TX1，以此类推。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerotenna-usd1.rst:81
#: 51715cf259a045eeaa8ed913cbf69a79
msgid "Next, set the parameters on the autopilot:"
msgstr "接下来，在飞控上设置以下参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerotenna-usd1.rst:83
#: 3da5778d652f4a07920602f9fe1170df
msgid "RNGFND1_TYPE = 24 (DroneCAN) Then Restart"
msgstr "RNGFND1_TYPE = 24（DroneCAN），然后重启"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerotenna-usd1.rst:84
#: 4f60404c9aa541eca36c90da06858800
msgid "RNGFND1_ORIENT = 25 (Down)"
msgstr "RNGFND1_ORIENT = 25（朝下）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerotenna-usd1.rst:85
#: c28d3956335c4d7391b11f8eea5372c6
msgid "RNGFND1_ADDR = 0 (For sensor_id = 0)"
msgstr "RNGFND1_ADDR = 0（对应 sensor_id = 0）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aerotenna-usd1.rst:89
#: a5e96671a53141b0b124af2e8d729967
msgid ""
"If there is more than one rangefinder in the system you will need to "
"determine the Sensor ID for the USD1. Look in CAN inspector for a message "
"\"uavcan_equiment_range_sensor_Measurement\" for its sensor_id."
msgstr ""
"如果系统中存在多个测距仪，需要确定 USD1 的传感器 ID。请在 CAN 检查器中查找消息 "
"`uavcan_equiment_range_sensor_Measurement`，查看其 sensor_id。"
